rule (modulo E) Leak_RevealSeed:
   [ !Thr_Signer( I, sd ), In( I ) ]
  --[ AuditGuard( I ) ]->
   [ PendingReveal( I, sd ) ]

  /* has exactly the trivial AC variant */

rule (modulo E) Audit_Reveal:
   [ PendingReveal( I, sd ) ] --[ RevealSeed( I ) ]-> [ Out( sd ) ]

  /* has exactly the trivial AC variant */

rule (modulo E) Verify_a0:
